# Copy to the origin host only. The filled-in file is host-local and ignored.
# Never commit certificate keys, provider tokens, or any rendered secret.

# Feature 003 note: this origin now runs an OUTBOUND Cloudflare Tunnel
# connector (deploy/cloudflared/). Caddy is a loopback-only streaming
# pass-through with no public listener - it holds no certificate secret and
# has no renewal duty, because there is no provider-to-origin TLS hop for it
# to authenticate (cloudflared's outbound connection owns that). Feature
# 002's ORIGIN_CERT_PATH / ORIGIN_KEY_PATH / ORIGIN_PULL_CA_PATH values are
# removed, not merely left blank - they no longer apply to this design.

# The GPU laptop's fixed WireGuard tunnel address. Its physical network and
# public source address are irrelevant to the origin proxy.
UPSTREAM_ORIGIN=http://10.10.0.2:3000

# Optional override for the Caddy access-log path.
CADDY_LOG_PATH=/var/log/caddy/local3d-access.log

# Directory containing maintenance.html, copied from deploy/caddy/maintenance/.
# REQUIRED on any origin whose filesystem does not have /srv/caddy/maintenance.
# If this points nowhere, handle_errors cannot find the page and the visitor
# receives a bare empty 504 instead of the project-controlled unavailable
# response FR-025 and SC-008 require - a silent failure with nothing to alert
# on. The approved origin's OS is still PENDING TARGET INSPECTION, so set this
# explicitly once the origin's actual layout is known rather than trusting the
# default. Verified live on 2026-09-06: with it set, an upstream-down request
# returns the full project page in 0.28s with no internal detail disclosed.
CADDY_MAINTENANCE_ROOT=/srv/caddy/maintenance
